<p>The project’s reviews disclose tool assistance and the limits of investigator independence; they are not journal peer review. <a href="/news/nomue-protocol-release-4-public-discussion/">Release 4 public discussion is open</a>, while its numerical implementation remains unresolved. No p-value or interval calculation is validated by these SS/F probes.</p></section>

